# capsule.px - weapon capsule pickup
# canvas 16x16, 4 frames = 4 weapon letters, order V, L, H, S (frame index = weapon; not an animation).
# gold rounded pod (gold ramp g G h H), K outline, recessed dark window with a bold cyan letter.
# light: top-left (H rim top-left, h faces, G/g bottom-right).
# smallest must-read feature: letter strokes 2 px wide (vertical) so V/L/H/S separate at 1x.
# anchor: frame centre (8,8).
palette
. transparent
1 #1c2238  steel-0
G #a87b22  gold-1
H #fff2a8  gold-3
K #0b0d1a  outline shared-dark
b #46c8ee  cyan-2
g #5e3f10  gold-0
h #e8c252  gold-2
ramp gold g G h H
